 rowspan="1" colspan="1">p</th></tr></thead><tbody valign="top"><tr><td rowspan="1" colspan="1">Number of hospitalizations* &#x0003e;1 - (n)</td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1">2082&#x000b1;2852 (69)</td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1">1126&#x000b1;1068 (98)</td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1">0.003</td></tr><tr><td rowspan="1" colspan="1">Number of hospitalizations* &#x0003e;2- (n)</td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1">2181&#x000b1;3104 (43)</td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1">1292&#x000b1;1484 (124)</td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1">0.014</td></tr><tr><td rowspan="1" colspan="1">Hospitalization longer than 7 days- (n)</td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1">2193&#x000b1;2384 (198)</td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1">782&#x000b1;805 (86)</td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1">&#x0003c;0.001</td></tr><tr><td rowspan="1" colspan="1">FEV1% predicted value below 50%- (n)</td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1">1007&#x000b1;1003 (87)</td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1">1240&#x000b1;969 (48)</td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1">0.189</td></tr><tr><td rowspan="1" colspan="1">FEV1% predicted value below 30%- (n)</td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1">1467&#x000b1;1012 (33)</td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1">1057&#x000b1;958(102)</td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1">0.037</td></tr><tr><td rowspan="1" colspan="1">History of smoking- (n)</td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1">1895&#x000b1;2342 (174)</td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1">1487&#x000b1;1652 (105)</td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1">0.090</td></tr><tr><td rowspan="1" colspan="1">Smoking 40 package-years or more- (n)</td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1">2266&#x000b1;2858 (101)</td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1">1383&#x000b1;1186 (71)</td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1">0.015</td></tr><tr><td rowspan="1" colspan="1">Presence of co-morbidities- (n)</td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1">1834&#x000b1;2191 (266)</td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1">748&#x000b1;372 (18)</td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1">0.001</td></tr><tr><td rowspan="1" colspan="1">Presence of more than one comorbidities- (n)</td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1">2041&#x00